            "sid": "NAM 2:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Wabalolaŋa puchi puchi nanyamuki dehi, hakwinza kumesu eyi. Hembaku chachiwahi itala dayitwa yanjita, talatalaku kunjila, koleshaku kumaya, koleshaku nankashi Ŋovu jeyi.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NAM.2.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NAM.2.1"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NAM 2:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NAM.2.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NAM.2.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NAM 2:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Muloŋa Yehova hakuleta cheŋi wukelepi waYakoba, neyi wukeleŋi waIsarela. Muloŋanayisukuli dehi kudi akwakusukula, anatamishi dehi nyitayi yanyivinyu yawu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NAM.2.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NAM.2.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NAM 2:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nkebu jawayilobu jindi ajichinanisha dehi nge; amayala omika anavwali dehi yichinana. Ifuku dakaloŋejayi, makálu indi enda abebema kwayikuŋu hohu be-be-be, enda anyinkesha nimayoŋa chi kweti niwoma. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NAM.2.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NAM.2.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NAM 2:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Makalu adi nakuzuwa nankashi munyikwakwa, hiyakudishinjeka shinjeka mumalubanza. Kuyitala adi neyi yimunyi, hiyakwenda lufuchi neyi chakenaŋa nvula. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NAM.2.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NAM.2.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NAM 2:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hakwanuka ayilobu jindi; hiyakwenda nakuhukana. Hiyakunyakala nawu ashiki kumpwembu yamukala, chuma chakuyijika hewulu achiloŋesha dehi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NAM.2.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NAM.2.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NAM 2:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Yenzelu yatuloŋa ayenzulula dehi, itala damwanta hidikunowa. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NAM.2.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NAM.2.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NAM 2:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "HaHuzabi ajikulahu dehi, amutwala dehi, ambuŋindi awambanda hiyakudila namazu adi neyi awatumbolu, iku adi nakudetola hantulu jawu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NAM.2.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NAM.2.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NAM 2:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nineve kufumisha kunyaka wekala neyi ŋiya dameji. Hela chochu, hiyakutemukamu. Akwawu akuyila nawu, Imanenu! Imanenu! Kwosi wukutala nihanyimaku. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NAM.2.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NAM.2.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NAM 2:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Pupenu siliva yawu, pupenu wuru wawu! Ochu yuma yawu yaswekawu, nimahetawu yuma yayiwahi amanaŋa wanyi.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NAM.2.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NAM.2.9"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NAM 2:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NAM.2.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NAM.2.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NAM 2:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Washala dehi wamukunkulwayi, mwosi nawa chumaku, kwachihembi hohu. Muchima wawu hiwukunowa mwivumu, manuŋu awu hiyakudeta bwaki bwaki, antu ejima atiya dehi nyima hakachi niŋwa, kumesu awu wejima wawu hikukufumunuka. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NAM.2.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NAM.2.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NAM 2:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kuchididi chawanyitupa nikuwudiilu wanyenzi yanyitupa, nikwendelapa mutupa naŋodindi nimwanawu, kwabulilaŋawu wakuyitiyisha woma kudi kudihi? ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NAM.2.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NAM.2.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NAM 2:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mutuŋa wadiŋi nakutabola yakwikutisha anyanindi, wadiŋi nakushotomwena aŋodi jindi anyama kunshiŋu jawu, wadiŋi nakwinzesha mayeŋu indi nawanyama anakwatiyi, kumatalindi kwalumbaminana mbiji jindi.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NAM.2.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NAM.2.12"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
